sequenceDiagram
    actor Arch as Architect
    participant API
    participant Orch as Orchestrator
    participant Q as Queue
    participant Run as Battle Engine
    participant Ref as Referee
    actor HJ as Human (HITL)

    Arch->>API: submit agent (before deadline)
    Note over API: author-can't-compete check
    API->>Orch: window locks
    Orch->>Orch: resolve agents vs ruleset
    Orch->>Q: fan out 3 runs / submission
    Q->>Run: run job
    Run->>Run: reveal task · enforce budgets · log
    Run->>Ref: transcript + artifacts (+ hash)
    Ref->>Ref: auto-checks → LLM judge → score
    alt margin < 5% or Finals
        Ref->>HJ: appeal review
        HJ-->>Ref: confirm / override
    end
    Ref->>API: standings + Glicko + season points
    API-->>Arch: recap + replays (timed reveal)
